To run NEIGHCRYS, type
   cp NEIGHCRYS_input/* .
   neighcrys.out < neighcrys_answers

In order to use your NEIGHCRYS output files as DMACRYS input, double the second number in the CUTO line and the number in the RDMA line.

To run DMACRYS, type
   dmacrys.out < BTXXV_5721.dmain > BTXXV_5721.dmaout
